      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n    public void setCountryCode(byte[] countryCode, OutcomeReceiver\u003cVoid, ThreadNetworkException\u003e receiver) {\n```\n\n`IOperationReceiver` is for binder APIs, don\u0027t use it here because you don\u0027t need a binder API.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 355,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 355,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "d5bfaf75f8ac3d0df31d026773d9a02bc18e4101",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ad7e2dcc_26487579",
        "filename": "thread/service/java/com/android/server/thread/ThreadNetworkControllerService.java",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 614,
      "author": {
        "id": 1693933
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-03T10:09:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This conversion isn\u0027t correct.\n\nPer the documentation of `ERROR_UNAVAILABLE`, it\u0027s a transient failure which can be recovered after retrying (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/thread/framework/java/android/net/thread/ThreadNetworkException.java;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1;l\u003d80?q\u003dThreadNetworkException\u0026gsn\u003dERROR_UNAVAILABLE\u0026gs\u003dKYTHE%3A%2F%2Fkythe%3A%2F%2Fandroid.googlesource.com%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2Fmain%3Flang%3Djava%3Fpath%3Dandroid.net.thread.ThreadNetworkException%2339ea7f047fbfd8669f079a8b68c3038b886187bfd316854de886f50487ff4790).\n\nWe should add VTS tests to enforce vendor HAL service to always support country code and avoid returning `OT_ERROR_NOT_IMPLEMENTED` from ot-daemon.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 614,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 614,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "d5bfaf75f8ac3d0df31d026773d9a02bc18e4101",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f720ac15_d9ad3d42",
        "filename": "thread/service/java/com/android/server/thread/ThreadNetworkCountryCode.java",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 68,
      "author": {
        "id": 1693933
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-03T10:09:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please also document the threading / synchronization model of this class. For example, whether if\u0027s thread-safe to call any of its public methods from any thread; And / or how are the member fields are protected, so what should new developers do to add more fields.\n\nYour current code is not thread-safe, some of the code uses `mHandler` to synchronize, while others use `synchronized` keyword. I suggest simply always use `synchronized` given this class does no async operations.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 64,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 68,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "d5bfaf75f8ac3d0df31d026773d9a02bc18e4101",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
