      "writtenOn": "2023-12-03T10:09:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n@RequiresApi(Build.VERSION_CODES.TIRAMISU)\npublic class ThreadNetworkCountryCode {\n```\n\nSo that we can get rid of the NewApi lints for TelephonyManager and WifiManager APIs.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "d5bfaf75f8ac3d0df31d026773d9a02bc18e4101",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "105bcfc4_88214283",
